.BraidsAndKnots.S4Irrep","kind":"structure","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/S4S3HalfSymmetricProjection.lean#L19-L28","doc":"The five irreducible representations of S_4, indexed by\npartitions of 4.  We encode only the data needed for the\nbranching rule: classical dimension and trivial-S_3 content\nunder restriction. ","signatureChunk":0}]}